{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured and verified inventory-worker on node1. It runs under OpenRC as the unprivileged inventorysvc account inside a root-owned chroot, with /var/lib/inventory as its only writable application directory. The existing Alpine release and kernel were preserved. A single node reboot confirmed automatic service, mount, confinement, and data recovery.","actions_performed":["Created the inventorysvc system account with a nologin shell.","Created a minimal root-owned BusyBox/musl chroot at /var/lib/inventory-chroot.","Created /var/lib/inventory with inventorysvc ownership and mounted it inside the chroot using persistent nodev,nosuid,noexec bind-mount options.","Created and enabled the inventory-worker OpenRC service with no-new-privileges.","Verified OpenRC stop/start behavior and filesystem confinement.","Restarted node1 exactly once and verified its changed boot identity and full recovery.","Removed temporary write-probe artifacts after verification."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Preserve the installed operating-system release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-473b3773a35d4978","cmd-de9e7ea4485f4829"],"summary":"Alpine Linux v3.23 and kernel 6.18.7-0-lts were observed before configuration and remained unchanged after restart."},{"requirement":"Run the worker as dedicated unprivileged account inventorysvc","command_ids":["cmd-c1365ffab9e4489b","cmd-de9e7ea4485f4829"],"summary":"Account uses /sbin/nologin; the live worker runs with UID 103, GID 104, and NoNewPrivs enabled."},{"requirement":"Manage the background worker as inventory-worker","command_ids":["cmd-0a32ba89a5234eae","cmd-de9e7ea4485f4829","cmd-185ec4006c1b4a08"],"summary":"OpenRC successfully stopped and started the worker, enables it in the default runlevel, and reports it started after reboot."},{"requirement":"Confine the filesystem view to a root-owned chroot","command_ids":["cmd-c1365ffab9e4489b","cmd-00e6dc3736cc4e08"],"summary":"The live process root is /var/lib/inventory-chroot; the jail and runtime tree are root-owned, and host /etc is unavailable inside it."},{"requirement":"Make /var/lib/inventory the only writable application directory","command_ids":["cmd-4e968fcfd4b3426e","cmd-00e6dc3736cc4e08"],"summary":"Unprivileged probes failed for every other jail directory and succeeded only in /var/lib/inventory, both before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart sequence","command_ids":["cmd-c1365ffab9e4489b","cmd-30b69598eef9449d","cmd-42d8eeb1217c4594","cmd-de9e7ea4485f4829","cmd-185ec4006c1b4a08"],"summary":"Healthy baseline used boot ID 4764a421-b601-4973-8855-d2ca0619516c; reboot acknowledgement was captured; node returned with boot ID e24b136d-2aaa-44d9-88d5-ef7326d8596e; service, bind mount, account, chroot, state, and advancing heartbeat recovered."}]}
